data: {"id": "e0cc15032fed405e-thinking-parallel_evidence-488", "run_id": "e0cc15032fed405e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据预采集结果，Prometheus 确认 Pod 仍处于 ImagePullBackOff（`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1`，reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"），但 Logs 和 Tracing 均为空。这需要 Kubernetes 事件的直接证据来确认 ImagePullBackOff 的具体原因（如 unauthorized, not found, timeout 等）。\n\n执行计划：\n1. `kubectl_describe` - 获取 Pod 详细状态和 Events 错误信息\n2. `kubectl_get_yaml` - 获取 Pod 的镜像配置以验证镜像引用\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789351594547, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

