data: {"id": "e0cc15032fed405e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1201", "run_id": "e0cc15032fed405e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_token", "tool_name": null, "content": "**。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789351605107, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "e0cc15032fed405e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1202", "run_id": "e0cc15032fed405e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与因果\n\n### 1. 候选原因：**镜像仓库 DNS 解析失败 → 无法拉取镜像 → ImagePullBackOff**\n\n**支持证据：**\n- Pod YAML 确认镜像引用为 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`，且 `imagePullSecrets: <absent>`（无认证凭据）。\n- Kubernetes Events 中 kubelet 报告的**关键错误原文**：\n  ```\n  Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": \n  failed to resolve reference \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": \n  failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/workload/manifests/missing\": \n  dial tcp: lookup registry.inva", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789351605154, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "e0cc15032fed405e-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "e0cc15032fed405e", "seq": 1203, "ts_ms": 1789351611926, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 30.64, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-02", "name": "workload-65b7f54794-jmq6b"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/e0cc15032fed405e-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "4e86abc518728b6b7693eb9b5a739845feb344715e4e4a14eecb775c50a4d32b", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "ea003073308539425c688d1fd99c6eb2d44a022fd253b8750f7349b7531d5967"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "e0cc15032fed405e-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "e0cc15032fed405e", "seq": 1204, "ts_ms": 1789351611927, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "e0cc15032fed405e-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "e0cc15032fed405e", "seq": 1205, "ts_ms": 1789351619832, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.906, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1478, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-jmq6b` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-jmq6b 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `ImagePullBackOff` | 确立核心异常状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed to pull image ... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 证明因域名解析失败导致拉取中断 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.image`: `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` | 定位引发解析失败的根源配置 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}` 值为 `1` | 独立观测到与 K8s 状态一致的等待原因 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status`: `Pending` | 确认 Pod 因无法启动容器而阻塞 |\n\n**证据印证与冲突分析：**\nKubernetes 状态（证据 1、5）直接反映容器卡死在 Pending 阶段；Kubelet 的 Event 记录（证据 2）给出了“no such host”的具体网络底层原因；Kubernetes 配置（证据 3）提供了该错误的配置源头（`registry.invalid`）。Prometheus 指标（证据 4）从时间序列观测角度交叉验证了当前容器正处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态，所有维度事实高度一致，无冲突。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 配置无效域名 \"registry.invalid\" → 节点 DNS 解析失败 (no such host) → kubelet 拉取镜像被网络层阻断 → Pod 进入 ImagePullBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 **Pod Spec 中配置的镜像仓库域名 `registry.invalid` 无效**（证据 3）。\n\n该配置直接导致节点执行 DNS 查询时失败，错误日志明确显示 `dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid ... no such host`（证据 2）。因为无法解析并连接镜像仓库，`kubelet` 无法拉取镜像，从而触发 `ErrImagePull`，随后系统进入指数退避重试，表现为 `ImagePullBackOff`（证据 1、4）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-jmq6b` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-jmq6b 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `ImagePullBackOff` | 确立核心异常状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed to pull image ... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 证明因域名解析失败导致拉取中断 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.image`: `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` | 定位引发解析失败的根源配置 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}` 值为 `1` | 独立观测到与 K8s 状态一致的等待原因 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status`: `Pending` | 确认 Pod 因无法启动容器而阻塞 |\n\n**证据印证与冲突分析：**\nKubernetes 状态（证据 1、5）直接反映容器卡死在 Pending 阶段；Kubelet 的 Event 记录（证据 2）给出了“no such host”的具体网络底层原因；Kubernetes 配置（证据 3）提供了该错误的配置源头（`registry.invalid`）。Prometheus 指标（证据 4）从时间序列观测角度交叉验证了当前容器正处于 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态，所有维度事实高度一致，无冲突。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 配置无效域名 \"registry.invalid\" → 节点 DNS 解析失败 (no such host) → kubelet 拉取镜像被网络层阻断 → Pod 进入 ImagePullBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 **Pod Spec 中配置的镜像仓库域名 `registry.invalid` 无效**（证据 3）。\n\n该配置直接导致节点执行 DNS 查询时失败，错误日志明确显示 `dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid ... no such host`（证据 2）。因为无法解析并连接镜像仓库，`kubelet` 无法拉取镜像，从而触发 `ErrImagePull`，随后系统进入指数退避重试，表现为 `ImagePullBackOff`（证据 1、4）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

